Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:03.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After the most extraordinary level{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打出极其非凡的水准后
