Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it has ended on a Medvedev default.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N却以梅德韦杰夫\N被判失格结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:10.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}5{\fs68}号晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.97,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}中网男单半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:14.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约前一晚逆转兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:16.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一场又面对梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:20.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}激烈对抗 为何以意外判罚结束？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This time the pressure does tell.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 压力终于起了作用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:35.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's been coming.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N此前就已经有这个苗头了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:50.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh well, that could have been{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 刚才那一下可能会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:51.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}pretty nasty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N相当危险
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:52.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But what a response{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这记回应太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:53.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Novak Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自诺瓦克 德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.51,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}破发点上 德约先左右调动梅总
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:59.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}对手伸展救球 回球短了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:01.27,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他马上进入前场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:04.67,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}用短斜线完成回破 追到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:34.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A ridiculously physical{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N体能消耗惊人的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:35.88,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}opening set of tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:39.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}盘点这一分 德约先扛住底线交换
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:42.73,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}等来短球 他用反手切削随球上网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:44.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}再在网前结束回合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:48.33,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 首盘打了{\fs78}79{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:50.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:52.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约一局救下{\fs78}6{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.68,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这样的压力 还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:24.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, just out of his reach.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 刚好超出了他的触球范围
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Djokovic continues to play{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而德约科维奇依旧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:29.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the big point so well today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天的关键分\N打得那么出色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:32.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}时 他又救下两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:33.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}守住之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约开始争取自己的破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:48.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N呀！呀！呀！\N呀！呀！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:02.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's just amazing depth.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球的落点深度真是惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The shot beforehand from Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说的是德约科维奇\N前一拍的击球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.68,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But this time{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:14.88,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he does find a way through.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他终于找到了突破口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, he just went straight{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 他直接回击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:55.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}back at him.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N朝对手打了回去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Djokovic collapses to the ground{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德约科维奇倒向地面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:03:58.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in a heap.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N整个人一下瘫倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.92,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}长回合被前后变化打断
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:04.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约冲向前场救球 却失衡倒地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:05.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一分属于梅总
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:08.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}下一次破发机会也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's magnificent from Medvedev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 梅德韦杰夫这一球太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你能相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just a flurry of errors{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N突然连续出现失误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:42.92,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Medvedev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a brilliant combination{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一组击球组合太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Djokovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自德约科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:52.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, can you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这结局 你能相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After the most extraordinary level{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打出极其非凡的水准后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:57.84,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in this match,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it has ended on a Medvedev default.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N却以梅德韦杰夫\N被判失格结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:05.68,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, no real protest{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N并没有真正的抗议
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:07.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Daniil Medvedev,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:09.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's hard to argue with{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但很难反驳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.88,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the decision from Mohamed Lahyani{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拉希亚尼作出的判罚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and the the ATP supervisor there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以及现场{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}监督的判罚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:17.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约再次破发 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:18.88,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}发球胜赛局{\fs78}15{\fs68}平
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:22.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}梅总死球击球误伤观众 被取消资格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:24.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}镜头没有呈现击中观众的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:28.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}德约赛后也表达了对伤者的关心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:32.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}18{\fs68}个破发点 德约救下{\fs78}16{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.57,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}关键分上的坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:37.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}让他在意外结尾之前 始终保有领先
